phy: rockchip: samsung-dcphy: add the D-PHY receive mode

The MIPI DC-PHY of the RK3576 also receives (CSI-2 cameras), but the
driver only transmits (DSI). A new PHY_MIPI_DPHY_SUBMODE_RX submode of
PHY_MODE_MIPI_DPHY selects the receiver; its setup (bias, analog lane
config, THS-SETTLE from the data rate, lane enable) follows Rockchip's
BSP kernel. No PLL in receive mode: the clock comes from the sensor.

